00:23:51.360 --> 00:24:07.999
Byron Mackay: that DEX from Human Layer has made pretty popular, and others have been iterating on. And quite frankly, other industries and other companies that I've seen have evolved into similar frameworks. So there seems to be some buy-in there. But one of the things that they point out is when you do research.

