00:55:56.300 --> 00:56:12.749
Byron Mackay: we as engineers are becoming very used to these environments that we're working in. We have Cloud Code, we have these, we have codecs, we have cursor, we have these things that we can leverage, and things that we can work in, and we feel very… we can feel very comfortable, very confident in the output.

